<title>NEW ZEALAND: Waste Management sees growth in 1997.</title>
<headline>Waste Management sees growth in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Waste Management New Zealand Ltd said on Thursday it was confident core business earnings would continue to grow, and the full-year effect of new contracts would provide shareholders with &quot;another positive year of growth in 1997&quot;.  </p>
<p>&quot;Directors are confident that the company's core business earnings will continue to grow and will be enhanced by the full year effect of new contracts to provide shareholders with another positive year of growth in 1997,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746  </p>
<p>Dividend carries 2.23 cps imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date May 9</p>
<p>Reg date May 2</p>
<p>    Ex div   May 5</p>
<p>Note - Waste Management Ltd is a waste collection and disposal company.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
